nswer-field/id #uuid "b77dd0bf-aa34-5abd-bd76-903f05843194" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/select} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186308100}] :question/id #uuid "25dc255f-1285-5a57-9fc0-d28154b2f004" :question/math-academy-id "q-334304" :question/problem "$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}{x}^{′}(t) &=4x(t)-7y(t) \\\\ {y}^{′}(t) &=7x(t)+4y(t)\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nConsider the system of linear differential equations above. The eigenvalues of the system's matrix are $\\lambda =4\\pm 7\\text{i}.$ Select the correct options in the reasoning below.$\\,$\nSince \n{{field-1}},\nthe equilibrium point (origin) is {{field-2}}." :question/worked-solution "Let $v=p+q\\text{i},$ where $p,q\\in {R}^{2},$ be an eigenvector corresponding to the eigenvalue $\\lambda =a+b\\text{i}.$\n\nThen, a complex solution of the system is given by\n\n$$\n{x}_{\\text{complex}}(t)=v{e}^{\\lambda t}.\n$$\n\nUsing Euler's formula, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{\\text{complex}}(t) & =v{e}^{(a+b\\text{i})t} \\\\  & ={e}^{at}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡(bt)+\\text{i}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(bt))(p+q\\text{i}) \\\\  & ={e}^{at}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡(bt)p-\\operatorname{sin}⁡(bt)q)+\\text{i}{e}^{at}(\\operatorname{sin}⁡(bt)p+\\operatorname{cos}⁡(bt)q).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the general solution of the system is\n\n$$\n\\text{x}(t)={c}_{1}{e}^{at}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡(bt)p-\\operatorname{sin}⁡(bt)q)+{c}_{2}{e}^{at}(\\operatorname{sin}⁡(bt)p+\\operatorname{cos}⁡(bt)q),\n$$\n\nwhere the parts $(\\operatorname{cos}⁡(bt)p-\\operatorname{sin}⁡(bt)q)$ and $(\\operatorname{sin}⁡(bt)p+\\operatorname{cos}⁡(bt)q)$ are bounded.\n\nNow, notice that $a=\\text{Re}(\\lambda )=4>0$ and ${e}^{at}={e}^{4t}\\to \\infty $ as $t\\to \\infty .$ Thus, we have a spiral that is traversed toward infinity as $t\\to \\infty .$ \n\nTherefore, since $\\text{Re}(\\lambda )>0,$ the equilibrium point (origin) is $\\text{an unstable spiral (source)}.$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186308594 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "22f9bd99-e77f-5e4e-9db3-8bb568f9310d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\text{Im}(\\lambda )>0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186305482} {:answer/id #uuid "33b33222-0be5-5522-abfe-f437c5237327" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\text{Im}(\\lambda )<0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186305637} {:answer/id #uuid "5e60a010-0bd4-5b23-9d7b-cd51ae1be986" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\text{Re}(\\lambda )>0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186306057} {:answer/id #uuid "650b8413-f499-5752-85f7-b2a0d94c4357" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\text{Re}(\\lambda )=0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186306125} {:answer/id #uuid "8d664ead-6d7e-5ccd-acb2-a7d2cc6b3048" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\text{Re}(\\lambda )<0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186306492} {:answer/id #uuid "fc6dc8e9-bf03-5647-983f-3a5d37785edb" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\text{Im}(\\lambda )=0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186307482}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\text{Re}(\\lambda )<0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186306492} :answer-field/id #uuid "016a07c4-4294-5c5e-8477-eab54506e764" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/select} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186307521} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "7d0beecb-228d-5714-93e3-1b64c8b338da" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "an unstable spiral (source)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186306343} {:answer/id #uuid "815fba2e-56de-5c0f-9ae1-90d44760483d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "a stable spiral (sink)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186306387} {:answer/id #uuid "a795ffa4-8fd3-5e6b-b566-4a944ef62e99" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "a center" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186306729}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "a stable spiral (sink)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186306387} :answer-field/id #uuid "f2040d15-1d78-5c0a-a9aa-e3fb10af8ee4" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/select} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186308288}] :question/id #uuid "2847a1e4-c6b3-5129-a8ea-a4d0cc32fc5a" :question/math-academy-id "q-334313" :question/problem "$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}{x}^{′}(t) &=-x(t)-3y(t) \\\\ {y}^{′}(t) &=3x(t)-y(t)\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nConsider the system of linear differential equations above. The eigenvalues of the system's matrix are $\\lambda =-1\\pm 3\\text{i}.$ Select the correct options in the reasoning below.$\\,$\nSince \n{{field-1}},\nthe equilibrium point (origin) is {{field-2}}." :question/worked-solution "Let $v=p+q\\text{i},$ where $p,q\\in {R}^{2},$ be an eigenvector corresponding to the eigenvalue $\\lambda =a+b\\text{i}.$\n\nThen, a complex solution of the system is given by\n\n$$\n{x}_{\\text{complex}}(t)=v{e}^{\\lambda t}.\n$$\n\nUsing Euler's formula, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{\\text{complex}}(t) & =v{e}^{(a+b\\text{i})t} \\\\  & ={e}^{at}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡(bt)+\\text{i}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(bt))(p+q\\text{i}) \\\\  & ={e}^{at}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡(bt)p-\\operatorname{sin}⁡(bt)q)+\\text{i}{e}^{at}(\\operatorname{sin}⁡(bt)p+\\operatorname{cos}⁡(bt)q).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the general solution of the system is\n\n$$\n\\text{x}(t)={c}_{1}{e}^{at}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡(bt)p-\\operatorname{sin}⁡(bt)q)+{c}_{2}{e}^{at}(\\operatorname{sin}⁡(bt)p+\\operatorname{cos}⁡(bt)q),\n$$\n\nwhere the parts $(\\operatorname{cos}⁡(bt)p-\\operatorname{sin}⁡(bt)q)$ and $(\\operatorname{sin}⁡(bt)p+\\operatorname{cos}⁡(bt)q)$ are bounded.\n\nNow, notice that $a=\\text{Re}(\\lambda )=-1<0$ and ${e}^{at}={e}^{-t}\\to 0$ as $t\\to \\infty .$ Thus, we have a spiral that is traversed toward the origin as $t\\to \\infty .$ \n\nTherefore, since $\\text{Re}(\\lambda )<0,$ the equilibrium point (origin) is $\\text{a stable spiral (sink)}.$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186308595 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "8a10e698-91d2-5c37-afd2-46c5e2d14d4c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "a center" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186306470} {:answer/id #uuid "dd4b1c92-2e4b-5864-843c-a7b3e4b2381d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "an unstable spiral (source)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186307203} {:answer/id #uuid "f0f78807-05a3-57a4-ab92-a617259081be" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "a stable spiral (sink)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186307362}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "a center" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186306470} :answer-field/id #uuid "5d13ab71-f658-5b04-bb32-ac65400cb312" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/select} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186307814} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1d2f9181-0dd1-5c92-8a95-727316d18b43" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\text{Im}(\\lambda )>0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186305421} {:answer/id #uuid "68b8b36e-5f94-5145-9fd8-6494701a1c77" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\text{Re}(\\lambda )>0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186306150} {:answer/id #uuid "9bc08d2f-8ae4-5b88-bd0f-781f644a9f84" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\text{Re}(\\lambda )=0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186306606} {:answer/id #uuid "d1a9aa8b-395c-57d1-9cd2-bc5abe365ce1" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\text{Im}(\\lambda )<0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186307096} {:answer/id #uuid "dd36f09e-5adc-5eb5-8af6-952c330b1ad0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\text{Im}(\\lambda )=0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186307201} {:answer/id #uuid "eb24baea-2a86-5613-ba2c-da117b63d0fc" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\text{Re}(\\lambda )<0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186307315}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\text{Re}(\\lambda )=0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186306606} :answer-field/id #uuid "8037fc3c-bc43-54b8-8fa0-b0d7c047a0aa" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/select} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186307924}] :question/id #uuid "071ba640-8567-515e-99df-db03fba5f2ae" :question/math-academy-id "q-334314" :question/problem "$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}{x}^{′}(t) &=-4y(t) \\\\ {y}^{′}(t) &=4x(t)\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nConsider the system of linear differential equations above. The eigenvalues of the system's matrix are $\\lambda =\\pm 4\\text{i}.$ Select the correct options in the reasoning below.\n\n$\\,$\nSince \n{{field-1}},\nthe equilibrium point (origin) is {{field-2}}." :question/worked-solution "Let $v=p+q\\text{i},$ where $p,q\\in {R}^{2},$ be an eigenvector corresponding to the eigenvalue $\\lambda =a+b\\text{i}.$\n\nThen, a complex solution of the system is given by\n\n$$\n{x}_{\\text{complex}}(t)=v{e}^{\\lambda t}.\n$$\n\nUsing Euler's formula, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{\\text{complex}}(t) & =v{e}^{(a+b\\text{i})t} \\\\  & ={e}^{at}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡(bt)+\\text{i}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(bt))(p+q\\text{i}) \\\\  & ={e}^{at}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡(bt)p-\\operatorname{sin}⁡(bt)q)+\\text{i}{e}^{at}(\\operatorname{sin}⁡(bt)p+\\operatorname{cos}⁡(bt)q).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the general solution of the system is\n\n$$\n\\text{x}(t)={c}_{1}{e}^{at}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡(bt)p-\\operatorname{sin}⁡(bt)q)+{c}_{2}{e}^{at}(\\operatorname{sin}⁡(bt)p+\\operatorname{cos}⁡(bt)q),\n$$\n\nwhere the parts $(\\operatorname{cos}⁡(bt)p-\\operatorname{sin}⁡(bt)q)$ and $(\\operatorname{sin}⁡(bt)p+\\operatorname{cos}⁡(bt)q)$ are bounded.\n\nNow, notice that $a=\\text{Re}(\\lambda )=0$ and ${e}^{at}={e}^{0\\cdot t}=1$ for all $t.$ Thus, we have an ellipse that curves around the origin. \n\nTherefore, since $\\text{Re}(\\lambda )=0,$ the equilibrium point (origin) is $\\text{a center}.$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186308596 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1e7c3d88-2319-5353-8aa6-20bdeda3c86b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\text{Im}(\\lambda )>0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186305439} {:answer/id #uuid "42c89c7e-9bd5-5af1-af42-7b9217f3016d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\text{Re}(\\lambda )=0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186305809} {:answer/id #uuid "5802077a-d4db-5bf3-81d9-a48d9ad240aa" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\text{Im}(\\lambda )=0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186306000} {:answer/id #uuid "67e61976-5cca-59f7-918f-173cc84dfb3c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\text{Re}(\\lambda )<0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186306140} {:answer/id #uuid "a84ef302-daa7-5f40-8092-9eee49c345ae" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\text{Im}(\\lambda )<0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186306740} {:answer/id #uuid "fa58e26f-e267-585c-995a-9a87cd332946" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\text{Re}(\\lambda )>0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186307472}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\text{Re}(\\lambda )=0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186305809} :answer-field/id #uuid "346b1d74-79f1-530f-a990-1f7318cbcccd" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/select} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186307685} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "24648cb8-a5a7-58ee-98f0-1ca1fe633f53" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "a center" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186305497} {:answer/id #uuid "491acaf0-2074-5fdc-8251-1ccebc5c8d59" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "a stable spiral (sink)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186305861} {:answer/id #uuid "a4f847ae-b472-5e91-8f24-b49952d13919" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "an unstable spiral (source)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186306704}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :ans