der the action of the linear transformation $T$ whose matrix $T$ is given by\n\n$$\nT=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 5 \\\\ 1 & 3\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nWhat is the original vector $v?$" :question/worked-solution "From the given information, we have \n\n$$\nT\\cdot v=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nWe need to reverse the action of the matrix $T.$ So, we multiply the above equation by ${T}^{-1},$ and we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{T}^{-1}\\cdot T\\cdot v & ={T}^{-1}\\cdot \\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ v & ={T}^{-1}\\cdot \\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we need to calculate the inverse of $T$, which is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{T}^{-1} & =\\frac{1}{6-5}\\begin{bmatrix}3 & -5 \\\\ -1 & 2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}3 & -5 \\\\ -1 & 2\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the original vector is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}v & ={T}^{-1}\\cdot \\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}3 & -5 \\\\ -1 & 2\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}13 \\\\ -5\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186354396 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "393c6ca7-70f9-574c-bc97-fa8b6ef26d7f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ -5\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186352096} {:answer/id #uuid "5095e48d-6a9d-587d-8641-7036179225b5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-5 \\\\ 7\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186352293} {:answer/id #uuid "63d71000-1f3c-5ccc-b7aa-7f3f9e9508aa" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-5 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186352454} {:answer/id #uuid "6f5a3e4c-94d3-5cde-8390-1bab7850301b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-6 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186352547} {:answer/id #uuid "84c2fb25-784c-5e46-a0fb