ve under the action of $T?$" :question/worked-solution "To find the image of the triangle under the action of $T$, we first create a matrix $X$ containing all of the vertices of the triangle:\n\n$$\nX=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 & 3 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 2\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nNow, we compute the image of $X$ under the action of $T$ by calculating the matrix product $TX:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}TX & =\\begin{bmatrix}0 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 & 3 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 0 & -2 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 2\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the coordinates of the image's vertices are $(-1,1)$, $(0,0),$ $(-2,2).$ Notice that all three points lie on the same line.\n\nSo, the image of our triangle under the action of $T$ is as follows:\n\n![](images/c2/c26cdc9a92481b7e2a7f9e128656d42c093b5fbb8d2ca4d02dc3bb262ce64341.png)"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186388883 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "19cb6f60-ad52-57c8-9c89-d3f0205b2ffd" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/4f/4fcb159117d6a3e3a2003e0d7e5611ba91c69399bded1830aca96a9a74fd092f.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186388885} {:answer/id #uuid "f79f3e9b-c241-51e1-b30f-a799e7db5d3c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/f2/f2aca56b6bdc527fb130951c73c7307b3ff45dbb16b2f382907f5950e75e99be.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186388886} {:answer/id #uuid "7c2f9d5e-b0db-59d4-8789-82570f920c25" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/47/476463dc46da737a676d5c6c78e34f0870cc8b9874e991c9b2bf806d8618bc17.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186388887} {:answer/id #uuid "b2aabbfd-9a67-5be5-af23-944942874c3c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/6f/6f3c5c10ba14789418a5029dc75d9537050ec1c74ad75e73881131585763644b.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186388888} {:answer/id #uuid "6a35029d-76b2-5a4b-9128-3f5c86afcd1a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/84/84edf4